OL,3,GNEWSATwelve taken to hospital after
OL,4,ADouglas flats fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwelve people have been taken to
OL,7,Fhospital following a fire at a block of
OL,8,Fflats in Douglas.
OL,10,FCrews arrived at the building on Bucks
OL,11,FRoad at about 03:40 BST on Wednesday
OL,12,Fmorning, the Isle of Man Fire and
OL,13,FRescue has said.
OL,15,FTwo people were trapped on the top
OL,16,Ffloor and were rescued by firefighters
OL,17,Fusing a ladder, with 10 others below
OL,18,Fmaking their way out themselves.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
