OL,3,GNEWSATwelve taken to hospital after
OL,4,ADouglas flats fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere were 12 people in total inside
OL,7,Fthe building at the time, all of whom
OL,8,Fwere treated at the scene and taken to
OL,9,FNoble's Hospital for "precautionary
OL,10,Fchecks".
